  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただの、とは？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ただのチョコレート、という意味です！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん、\r\n最近よく残業しているとお聞きしたので",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "せめて差し入れくらいはできたらなぁ、と──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうな……！\r\nその心遣いだけでまだまだ働ける気がしてくるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それはよかっ──",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あれ！？　いいんですかね……！？\r\nもともと残業してるのにさらに働いちゃって──",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははははは！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あっダメなやつじゃないですか！　ダメですよ\r\nプロデューサーさん、自分を大事にしてください！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、おう！　もちろんわかってるよ\r\n──こうやってふざけて息抜きもさせてもらってるしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "で、そうだ、差し入れ──\r\n選択肢があるってことは、全部用意してくれてる……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あ、はい！\r\nオーダー後に準備がいるものはありますが……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか。じゃあ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全部欲しい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0220",
    "autoWaitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかく用意してくれたんだ、\r\n全部受け取らせてもらえたら嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はチョコで疲労回復に努める！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──ふふっ\r\nありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000010001/20000100010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000100010130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ではお任せください！　フォンダンショコラを温めつつ、\r\nホットチョコレートを作ってきます！",
